{"name":"Captivated","hex":"#947cae","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"captivated","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["rapt; mesmerized"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of captivate"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/captivated"}],"entries":[{"title":"Captivated, by You","blocks":[{"text":"Captivated, by You  is a Japanese manga written and illustrated by Yama Wayama. Originally written as a doujinshi in February 2019, the manga was later acquired by the Comic Beam editorial department, who published the manga in one volume in August 2019. A television drama adaptation aired from January to February 2021. An anime television series adaptation produced by Doga Kobo aired from August to September 2025."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/2e/Captivated%2C_by_You_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Captivated%2C_by_You"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/2e/Captivated%2C_by_You_cover.jpg/250px-Captivated%2C_by_You_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/2e/Captivated%2C_by_You_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/2e/Captivated%2C_by_You_cover.jpg/250px-Captivated%2C_by_You_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACaptivated%2C_by_You_cover.jpg"}],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Purple Sunset Over Apartments","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Purple_Sunset_Over_Apartments.jpg/500px-Purple_Sunset_Over_Apartments.jpg","ratio":0.75,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Purple_Sunset_Over_Apartments.jpg","share":0.1